The release binaries statically link third-party Rust crates (notably egui,
eframe and windows-sys, plus their transitive dependencies). Those crates are
distributed under their own licenses — predominantly MIT OR Apache-2.0 — and the
exact versions are pinned in Cargo.lock, with each crate's license text
available from its published source.
